## Installation

{{ 'step_bundle_introduction.section_7.paragraphs.0'|trans }} :

```json
"require": {
    ...
    "idci/step-bundle": "~1.5"
},
```

{{ 'step_bundle_introduction.section_7.paragraphs.1'|trans }} :

```sh
$ composer require idci/step-bundle:~1.5
```

{{ 'step_bundle_introduction.section_7.paragraphs.2'|trans }} :

```sh
$ composer update
```

{{ 'step_bundle_introduction.section_7.paragraphs.3'|trans }} :

```php
<?php
// app/AppKernel.php

public function registerBundles()
{
    $bundles = array(
        ...
        new JMS\SerializerBundle\JMSSerializerBundle(),
        new IDCI\Bundle\StepBundle\IDCIStepBundle(),
    );
}
```

{{ 'step_bundle_introduction.section_7.paragraphs.4'|trans }} :

```yaml
imports:
    ...
    - { resource: @IDCIStepBundle/Resources/config/config.yml }
```

